  "fieldNotes": {
    "truckGate": "2025-02 Street View shows the north dock court opening directly onto Glenfield Ave with no barrier, booth, or checkpoint — Google's camera shoots straight into the court (trailers at doors, tractor parked). Chain-link frontage has open driveway gaps; parked-open slide gates may exist for after-hours closure but there is no active control.",
    "backupSensitive": "North-face docks are one truck-length off the public street; trucks set up for backing from Glenfield Ave itself, and any queue sits on the street.",
    "dockDoors": "~12 doors on the north face (NE court), ~15-18 on the east face, a few on the south drive; 30 estimated.",
    "dropArea": "West yard holds scattered trailer rows (~30) plus NW-corner rows along the frontage; band 25-50.",
    "railServed": "An overgrown tree-lined rail spur corridor forms the SW boundary and dead-ends near the west yard — historic spur, no active track into the property visible.",
    "shipRcvSeparate": "A single 'Shipping/Receiving' directional sign at the west drive suggests one combined check-in flow despite two dock faces.",
    "entryExitSeparate": "Three independent open accesses: west-yard drive, north dock court, east apron street access."
